Third-party code

No third-party source is included in this repository: nothing is vendored, so
the module archive contains only the code above.

One tool has an external dependency at build time. `cmd/judge` uses the
Anthropic Go SDK to call a model:

    github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go
    Copyright 2023 Anthropic, PBC — MIT License

which brings in these transitively, each under MIT, BSD-3-Clause or Apache-2.0:

    github.com/bahlo/generic-list-go
    github.com/buger/jsonparser
    github.com/invopop/jsonschema
    github.com/pb33f/ordered-map/v2
    github.com/standard-webhooks/standard-webhooks/libraries
    github.com/tidwall/gjson
    github.com/tidwall/match
    github.com/tidwall/pretty
    github.com/tidwall/sjson
    go.yaml.in/yaml/v4
    golang.org/x/sync

The other five tools — ratchet, strata, lens, docket and plumb — link nothing
outside the Go standard library. `go install` any of them and the resulting
binary carries no third-party code.
